version: 1.0.0
repository-code: INSERT REPOSITORY URL BEFORE RELEASE
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a re-analysis of the Faller et al. (2019) boundary-avoidance
  task dataset. Trains a multimodal decoder on peripheral physiological signals,
  converts its output into a continuous arousal index, and tests that index
  against task performance, task phase, and baseline individual differences.
keywords:
  - arousal
  - brain-computer interface
  - neurofeedback
  - electroencephalography
  - heart rate variability
